==Description==
'''Classic Roblox''' is a cosmetic [[Modifiers|modifier]]. This modifier applies two other modifiers, the [[Retro Death]] and [[Classic Oof]] modifier.

'''Classic Roblox''' is active in [[Classic Candy Cane Lane]], [[Classic Winter]], [[Classic Forest Camp]], [[Classic Island Chaos]] and [[Classic Castle]].

==Effects==
When applied, '''Classic Roblox''' will apply two modifiers, [[Retro Death]] and [[Classic Oof]], as a way to make the match feel more like old Roblox.

